    "description": "Advisor endpoints (specs 20-27). Run 'Auth > Login as advisor' first: it sets the acadmate_session cookie, which Postman sends on every later request to localhost. Other advisors: daniel.kim@pac.edu (pending approvals 1701-1705), maya.brooks@pac.edu. Data-changing requests alter the demo data; reset with `python reset_db.py --yes && python seed_data.py`.",
